'''Megidora''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added on [[Version 2.2 Update|Version 2.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] and [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] improves health, attack power, speed and range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

